{"server":"jp","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_07_beg","groupId":"act45side","stageId":"act45side_07","title":"永遠に輝くアルバム","storyCode":"SS-7","avgTag":"戦闘前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"87fa92ed4dc6c79d04fd8ccd4a3fd74cd9a3af7d33acfce02b164e3dfbdfce86","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"祥子は夢の中で家族と幸せな時間を過ごしていた。「母」と散歩しながら思い出話に花を咲かせていたところ、仕事中のヴィグナ、アイリス、ベナと再会する。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g6_sakikopianoroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上手になったわね、祥子ちゃん。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豊川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"そうかしら……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子ちゃんが成長したことくらいわかるわ。お母さんだもの。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"お仕事がどんなに大変でも、ピアノだけはずっと頑張ってきたんでしょう？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豊川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"お母様……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子ちゃん、外で色んな経験をしてきたのよね……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"練習の邪魔して悪いけど、ご飯ができたよ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g5_sakikodininghall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豊川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"美味しい……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父","speakerId":"avg_npc_1940_1","isRemote":false,"text":"どうだ、お父さんなかなか上手だろう？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子ちゃんは知らないでしょうけど……この味になるまで、何度も試食させられたのよ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父","speakerId":"avg_npc_1940_1","isRemote":false,"text":"このサラダ、味見してみてほしい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豊川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ん――美味しいですわ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父","speakerId":"avg_npc_1940_1","isRemote":false,"text":"なかなか上手だろう？　祥子が美味しいって言ってくれるように、何度もレシピを研究したんだぞ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父","speakerId":"avg_npc_1940_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子の好きなご飯、まだまだ作ってあるからな。さあ、どんどん食べてくれ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豊川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ええ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g5_sakikodininghall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豊川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"う……うぅ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子ちゃん……？　祥子ちゃん！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父","speakerId":"avg_npc_1940_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ど、どうしたんだ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豊川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少し、食べすぎましたわ……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"31_g3_mini12_farmland"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子ちゃん、少しは良くなった……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父","speakerId":"avg_npc_1940_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ごめんな、祥子。お父さんつい作りすぎちゃって……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ほんと、清告さんったらいつもああなんだから……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"でもそれがあの人らしくて、可愛いところでもあるし……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子ちゃん、お父さんのこと許してあげてね？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豊川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"それは……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"お父さんはね、祥子ちゃんのことを愛してるのよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豊川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"――！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"もちろん、お母さんも。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二人のことを、心から愛してるわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豊川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"お母様、どうして急にそのようなことを……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"あなたが家を離れてから、昔のアルバムを見返すようになってね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生まれた時から、一歳、二歳、三歳……って。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豊川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"そのような時のこと、もう覚えていませんわ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"そうかもしれないわね。でも親にとっては、子供はずっと変わらずに、一番大切で、一番特別な存在なのよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生まれたばかりのあなたは、手のひらが私の半分もなかったの。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"でも……ほら、今は私よりも大きくなったのね。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"母は祥子の手を取り、二人の手のひらをゆっくりと重ね合わせる。\nひとりでに、祥子の指は母の手を強く握り締めていた。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豊川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"お母様の手、すごく温かい……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ええ、お母さんはここにいるわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豊川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"お母様……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"泣いていいのよ、祥子ちゃん。昔あなたが泣いてた時、こうやって慰めていたの。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豊川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……昔のわたくし、そんなに泣き虫でしたの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小さい頃はね。あの頃の祥子ちゃんは、よくキャンディひとつで泣いていたわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今はとても強い子になったけど、あの頃の祥子ちゃんは本当に泣き虫だったのよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豊川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"そ、そうだったかしら。そんな記憶、全くありませんわ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"うふふ、お母さんは嘘ついたりしないわ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豊川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"では……お母様は、わたくしの高校の入学式を覚えてます？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ええ、もちろん覚えているわ。あの日は清告さんと祥子ちゃんの三人で、校門の前で記念写真を撮ったわね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豊川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"そうでしたわね……懐かしいですわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豊川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ふふっ、ねえお母様、もっとお話を聞かせてくださる？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子ちゃん、今日はとても甘えん坊さんね。……それもそうね、久しぶりにお家に帰ってきてくれたんだもの。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豊川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"お家……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ふふっ。それならもっとお話ししちゃおうかしら。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ええと、どこから話そうかしら……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豊川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"でしたら、わたくしが生まれたときから、ずっと……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ええ、はじめから話すわね。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"そうして、母と娘は肩を並べ、一歩ずつ歩調を合わせるように農地の間を歩いていた。まるで、いつまでもそのまま二人で歩いていけるかのように。\n過去の美しかった時と変わらず、ゆったりと歩き、どこかで立ち止まることもない。\n二人の手は、まるでお腹の中にいた頃のへその緒のように親子を繋いでいた。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祥子――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ヴィグナ","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"よかった。祥子、ちゃんと家に帰れてたんだね！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アイリス","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ヴィグナさん、車の調子が何やらおかしいですわ！　いったん止めていただけませんこと？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ヴィグナ","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"えっと……な、何これ！？　ロドスで習った操作方法と違うんだけど！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ヴィグナ","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ダメ！　止められない！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アイリス","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ぶつかってしまいますわ――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ベナ","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祥子さんたち、早く避けて――！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
